  "kind": "ETDF",
  "text_count": 111,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "I have to go! I've gotta do this,\nfor everyone's sake!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12104,
      "_bytes": 54,
      "translation": "¡Tengo que ir! ¡Lo tengo que hacer,\npor el bien de todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "Uh-huh. Trying to look cool?",
      "speaker_id": 9002,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12159,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Ahá... ¿Quieres quedar bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "Who's there?",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12188,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¿Quién es?"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "So you wanna go up that mountain\nall by yourself?",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12201,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¿Quieres subir a la montaña\ntú solito?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Gomamon! Don't try to stop me!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12251,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¡Gomamon! ¡No trates de pararme!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Okay.",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12282,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "Vale."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "And don't follow me! I'm doing\nthis on my own!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12288,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡Y no me sigas! ¡Esto es\ncosa mía!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Well, I've got some of business of\nmy own on that mountain.",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12335,
      "_bytes": 59,
      "translation": "Bueno, tengo cosas que hacer...\nen la montaña."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "Suit yourself!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12395,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Como quieras!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Seriously, Joe, be honest. You'd \nbe completely lost trying to go up\nthere alone, wouldn't you?",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12410,
      "_bytes": 95,
      "translation": "En serio, Joe, francamente.\nEstarías completamente perdido si\nquisieras ir tú solo, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "Don't be stupid!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12506,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¡No seas bobo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Joe! That's the wrong way!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12523,
      "_bytes": 26,
      "translation": "¡Joe! ¡No es por ahí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "I-I was about to turn back!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12550,
      "_bytes": 27,
      "translation": "¡I-Iba a dar la vuelta!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "Anyway, this is a really big\nmountain.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12578,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "En fin, es una montaña muy\ngrande."
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Giving up already?",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12617,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¿Ya lo dejas?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Not at all!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12636,
      "_bytes": 11,
      "translation": "¡Para nada!"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "Let's take a break for bit! We've\nprobably got at least half the\nmountain left.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12648,
      "_bytes": 79,
      "translation": "¡Descansemos un rato! Aún nos\nqueda por lo menos la mitad de\nla montaña."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "You're not doing half bad, Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12728,
      "_bytes": 31,
      "translation": "¡No lo estás haciendo mal, Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "You too, Gomamon!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12760,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Ni tú, Gomamon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "What's that?!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12778,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡¿Qué es eso?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "An earthquake?!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12792,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "¡¿Un terremoto?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Those black gears!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12808,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¡Las ruedas negras!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Why are they coming out of there?\nLet's go check it out! Maybe we'll\nfigure something out!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12827,
      "_bytes": 90,
      "translation": "¿Por qué salen de aquí? ¡Vayamos a\nechar un vistazo! ¡Quizás podamos\ndescubrir algo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Okay!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12918,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Vale!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "I'm sure there was something weird\ngoing on around here. Let's look a\nlittle closer!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 12924,
      "_bytes": 84,
      "translation": "Estoy seguro de que hay algo\nextraño en todo esto. ¡Miremos más\nde cerca!"
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "Wait! What's that? That sound...",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13009,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Espera! ¿Qué es eso? Ese sonido..."
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "It's Unimon! He's a really wise\nand peaceful Digimon!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13042,
      "_bytes": 53,
      "translation": "¡Es Unimon! ¡Un Digimon pacífico\ny sabio!"
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "We should hide! You haven't\nexactly been giving us reliable \ninformation on Digimon so far.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13096,
      "_bytes": 91,
      "translation": "¡Escondámonos! No es que hayas\nsido la fuente más fiable sobre\nDigimon hasta ahora..."
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Maybe so, but...",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13188,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "Bueno, pero..."
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "He's drinking water! So that's\nwhat he was doing.",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13205,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Está bebiendo! Así que eso hacía."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "I told you it'd be fine! Let's get\na closer look!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13255,
      "_bytes": 49,
      "translation": "¡Ya te dije que no pasa nada!\n¡Acerquémonos un poco!"
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "This is bad!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13305,
      "_bytes": 12,
      "translation": "¡Algo va mal!"
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "His eyes are going crazy.",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13318,
      "_bytes": 25,
      "translation": "Tiene la mirada ida."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "Mmm! I slept well! I wonder if\nJoe's up yet...",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13344,
      "_bytes": 46,
      "translation": "¡Qué bien he dormido! ¿Se habrá\ndespertado Joe?"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "\"I'll be back soon. Stay here and\nwait for me. Joe.\"",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13391,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "\"Volveré pronto. Esperadme aquí.\nJoe.\""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "He didn't go to Infinity Mountain\nby himself, did he?! This is bad!\nEveryone, get up!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13444,
      "_bytes": 85,
      "translation": "No habrá ido él solo al Monte\nMugen, ¡¿no?! ¡Algo va mal!\n¡Todos! ¡Despertad!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Joe went to Infinity Mountain\nalone?",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13530,
      "_bytes": 36,
      "translation": "¿Joe ha ido al Monte Mugen,\nsolo?"
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "That's what it looks like. What\nshould we do?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13567,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "Eso parece. ¿Qué hacemos?"
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "Okay, there's only one thing to\ndo! I'm going after him!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13613,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "Sólo hay una cosa que podamos\nhacer. ¡Vamos a buscarle!"
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "I'll go with you!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13670,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Voy contigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "Matt, you should stay here and\nprotect the others! We can't risk \nendangering everyone right now.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13688,
      "_bytes": 99,
      "translation": "Matt, ¡deberías quedarte y\nproteger a los demás! No nos\npodemos permitir el riesgo."
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "Tai...!\nGot it. Be careful!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13788,
      "_bytes": 30,
      "translation": "¡Tai...!\nVale. ¡Ten cuidado!"
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "Okay, let's go! We'll catch up\nwith him if we ride on Birdramon!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13819,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¡Vale, vámonos! ¡Lo encontraremos\nrápido si vamos con Birdramon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "So reckless, going up there\nwithout us. We're coming to save\nyou, Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13884,
      "_bytes": 70,
      "translation": "Menuda locura, yendo sin los\ndemás. ¡Vamos a salvarte, Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Matt, you should stay here and\nprotect the others.",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 13955,
      "_bytes": 52,
      "translation": "Matt, deberías quedarte y\nproteger a los demás."
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "Got it. Be careful!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14008,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "Vale. ¡Ten cuidado!"
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "Okay, let's go! We'll catch up\nwith him if we ride on Birdramon!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14028,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¡Vale, vámonos! ¡Lo encontraremos\nrápido si vamos con Birdramon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Joe went up Infinity Mountain by\nhimself. It's dangerous! We can't\nleave him alone up there!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14093,
      "_bytes": 92,
      "translation": "Joe fue al Monte Mugen él\nsolo. ¡Es peligroso! ¡No podemos\ndejarle allí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "I'll go with you!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14186,
      "_bytes": 17,
      "translation": "¡Iré contigo!"
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "No, Tai, you should stay here\nand protect the others!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14204,
      "_bytes": 56,
      "translation": "¡No, Tai, debes quedarte y\nproteger a los demás!"
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "Got it! Be careful!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14261,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Vale! ¡Ten cuidado!"
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "All right, take care of everyone\nelse!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14281,
      "_bytes": 38,
      "translation": "¡Muy bien, cuida de todos los\ndemás!"
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Okay, let's go! We'll catch up\nwith him if we ride on Birdramon!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14320,
      "_bytes": 64,
      "translation": "¡Vale, vámonos! ¡Lo encontraremos\nrápido si vamos con Birdramon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "We're trapped! There's no way out!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14385,
      "_bytes": 34,
      "translation": "¡Estamos atrapados! ¡No hay salida!"
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "At this rate...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14420,
      "_bytes": 15,
      "translation": "A este paso..."
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14436,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Are you two all right?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14441,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Estáis ambos bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "You came to save us! Now\nthere's nothing left for us\nto be afraid of!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14464,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "¡Has venido a salvarnos! ¡No\ntenemos nada de qué preocuparnos\nahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "english": "Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14534,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "english": "Are you two all right?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14539,
      "_bytes": 22,
      "translation": "¿Estáis ambos bien?"
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "english": "You came to save us! Now\nthere's nothing left for us\nto be afraid of!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14562,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "¡Has venido a salvarnos! ¡No\ntenemos nada de qué preocuparnos\nahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "english": "You came to save us! Now\nthere's nothing left for us\nto be afraid of!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14632,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "¡Has venido a salvarnos! ¡No\ntenemos nada de qué preocuparnos\nahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "english": "You came to save us! Now\nthere's nothing left for us\nto be afraid of!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14702,
      "_bytes": 69,
      "translation": "¡Has venido a salvarnos! ¡No\ntenemos nada de qué preocuparnos\nahora!"
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "english": "Whoaaaaaa!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14772,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Uaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "english": "Whoaaaaaa!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14783,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Uaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "english": "Whoaaaaaa!",
      "speaker_id": 1021,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14794,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Uaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "english": "Whoaaaaaa!",
      "speaker_id": 9001,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14805,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Uaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "english": "Guys!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14816,
      "_bytes": 5,
      "translation": "¡Chicos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "english": "That black gear is what's making\nUnimon rampage!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14822,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "¡Esa rueda negra es la que\nenfurece a Unimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "english": "The black gear...If I get rid of\nit, I might be able to stop him!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14871,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "La rueda negra... ¡Si se la quito,\nquizás lo pueda detener!"
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "english": "Everyone!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14937,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Todos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "english": "That black gear is what's making\nUnimon rampage!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14947,
      "_bytes": 48,
      "translation": "¡Esa rueda negra es lo que\nenfurece a Unimon!"
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "english": "The black gear...If I get rid of\nit, I might be able to stop him!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 14996,
      "_bytes": 65,
      "translation": "La rueda negra... ¡Si se la quito,\nquizás lo pueda detener!"
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "english": "Now! Waaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15062,
      "_bytes": 14,
      "translation": "¡Ahora! ¡Ahhh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "english": "Brrrrrngh! Hyiiiii!",
      "speaker_id": 4901,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15077,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Brrrrrngh! ¡Hyiiiii!"
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "english": "Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15097,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "english": "Uwaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15102,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Uwaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "english": "Joooooou!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15113,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Jooooooe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "english": "Brrrrrngh! Hyiiiii!",
      "speaker_id": 4901,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15123,
      "_bytes": 19,
      "translation": "¡Brrrrrngh! ¡Hyiiiii!"
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "english": "Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15143,
      "_bytes": 4,
      "translation": "¡Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "english": "Uwaaaaaah!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15148,
      "_bytes": 10,
      "translation": "¡Uwaaaaaah!"
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "english": "Joooooou!",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15159,
      "_bytes": 9,
      "translation": "¡Jooooooe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "english": "Are you okay, Joe?",
      "speaker_id": 2631,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15169,
      "_bytes": 18,
      "translation": "¿Estás bien, Joe?"
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "english": "You saved me, Ikkakumon! But\nUnimon's faster than I thought, so\nbe careful!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15188,
      "_bytes": 75,
      "translation": "¡Me has salvado, Ikkakumon!\n¡Pero Unimon es muy rápido, ten\nmucho cuidado!"
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "english": "Okay! Hold on tight and leave it\nto me!",
      "speaker_id": 2631,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15264,
      "_bytes": 39,
      "translation": "¡Vale! ¡Agárrate y déjamelo a mí!"
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "english": "We did it! We did it! We did it!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15304,
      "_bytes": 32,
      "translation": "¡Lo conseguimos! ¡Lo conseguimos!"
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "english": "Not bad, Joe!",
      "speaker_id": 1011,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15337,
      "_bytes": 13,
      "translation": "¡Nada mal Joe!"
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "english": "Joe's courage made Gomamon evolve,\ndidn't it?",
      "speaker_id": 1031,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15351,
      "_bytes": 45,
      "translation": "La valentía de Joe causó la\ndigievolución, ¿no?"
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "english": "Well, I wouldn't say that...",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15397,
      "_bytes": 28,
      "translation": "Bueno, no creo..."
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "english": "Nah! It wasn't because of Joe's\ncourage, it was because of my hard\nwork!...I think.",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15426,
      "_bytes": 83,
      "translation": "¡Nah! ¡No fue el valor de Joe, fue\nmi trabajo duro!... Creo."
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "english": "Thank you, Gomamon! You saved us!",
      "speaker_id": 1051,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15510,
      "_bytes": 33,
      "translation": "¡Gracias Gomamon! ¡Nos has salvado!"
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "english": "Huh?! I don't...",
      "speaker_id": 2621,
      "line_type": 2,
      "_offset": 15544,
      "_bytes": 16,
      "translation": "¿Eh? Yo no..."
    },
    {
